    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/b27230ac150f9327ac75c297cd842b37.avif?t=1746865974\" width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...is a fast-paced side-scrolling shooter about primates getting access to weaponry way above their paygrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is in early development and everything shown is subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/e923395944030dcbb46cf69182c85c71.avif?t=1746865974\" width=388 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 7 other players across the world to see who's the king of the jungle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced PvP gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes such as Team Deathmatch, Capture the Flag, and Gun Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/cdb65af654f9976a2dd18bd712f73406.avif?t=1746865974\" width=388 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to fend off the ruthless wildlife of the forest!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless wave-based PvE gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or cooperatively online</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/af60e412a410718c58d1cb9b01a07a4d.avif?t=1746865974\" width=388 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to become the best mammal you can be!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mission structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/b27230ac150f9327ac75c297cd842b37.avif?t=1746865974\" width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...is a fast-paced side-scrolling shooter about primates getting access to weaponry way above their paygrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is in early development and everything shown is subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/e923395944030dcbb46cf69182c85c71.avif?t=1746865974\" width=388 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 7 other players across the world to see who's the king of the jungle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced PvP gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes such as Team Deathmatch, Capture the Flag, and Gun Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/cdb65af654f9976a2dd18bd712f73406.avif?t=1746865974\" width=388 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to fend off the ruthless wildlife of the forest!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless wave-based PvE gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or cooperatively online</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382860/extras/af60e412a410718c58d1cb9b01a07a4d.avif?t=1746865974\" width=388 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to become the best mammal you can be!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mission structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li></ul>",
